window.products.push({"id":492051,"name":"Kate and Laurel Rhodes Modern Octagon Wall Mirror, White 25x25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sjk69HDxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorating with mirrors is lots of fun especially when they come in a bold and versatile shape like the Kate and Laurel Rhodes octagon wall mirror. No matter what interior decorating style you want to go with, an octagon shaped mirror can bring added dimension. Not only can it be used as a much-needed accessory, but with a bit of imagination, it can become a real focal point of your home. The understated elegance of the thinly sleek frame enhances the smart bevel of the glass it surrounds and creates a modern take on a classic design. Used on its own or in combination with your other home decor items, this mirror is sure to fit in with your best look, creating an eye-catching exhibit of pure inspiration. The shape is a great way to break up the straight lines of a gallery display wall or just the right size for smaller wall spaces or even hang it directly above a sink making it perfect for a vanity. The outside dimensions of this octagon mirror are 24. 75 x 24. 75 inches. The inner mirror is exactly 24 x 24 Inches and the D-ring mounting hardware comes installed on the back, which will keep the mirror flat and secure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sjk69HDxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B0BXQ7NY71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXQ7NY71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXQ7NY71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
