window.products.push({"id":492135,"name":"Hanukkah Menorah Oil Cups – Crystal Elegant Holders for Chanukah Menorah Oil or Shabbos Oil Candles – Durable Quality, Long-Lasting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BsTrL3fUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing will illuminate your space better than Ner Mitzvah! With our amazing oil cups, you'll be lighting your room like never before and create a calming mood all while accentuating your home's decor. Amazing construction and easy to put into any standard Hannukah menorah or using every Shabbos, you'll be more than satisfied with them for all of your lighting purposes. PRODUCT FEATURES - Crystal Glass Design - 3 Sizes to fit different Menorahs. see dimensions diagram in product images - High Quality Durable Glass Material - Super Safe for Home and Religious Settings - Fits All Standard Menorahs - Washable and Reusable - Perfect for Shabbos, Hanukah, General Lighting Purposes - Beautiful Display in Home, Bedroom, Kitchen, Anywhere! CONVENIENT LIGHTING Easily fill up your cup with oil to keep your flame burning for as long as you need! These are super convenient and provide you with a perfect alternative to standard candle lighting to create a calming and warm atmosphere in your home. They're perfect for religious practices and they fit right onto all standard menroahs when Hannukah comes back around. EASY TO USE These oil cups are easy to use and reusable! Simply wash the cup out of any oil residue and refill with oil and add a new wick whenever its time to light up your home again. They're long lasting, durable, and provide premium safety for you and your family members. ABOUT NER MITZVAH Ner Mitzvah, family operated since the 1940s, consistently brings you the best in Mitzva, Judaica & religious items. From Shabbos, Chanukah, Yahrtzet or havdallah candles, to Shabbat lamp oil, aluminum candle holders, dreidels and many more Judaic gift items, supplies and resources -Ner Mitzvah is your premier Judaica source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BsTrL3fUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B08223NRV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08223NRV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08223NRV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
