window.products.push({"id":492232,"name":"One (1) XL Non-Stick Silicone Cookie Sheet Mat Specifically Designed for 16\" x 14\" Cookie Sheets • 2 Inches Wider Than All Other Silicone Baking Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jn23vaq7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What makes the difference between a good Silicone Baking Mat and a GREAT Silicone Baking Mat? Attention to detail! We at Kitchen Executive Chef do not aim to be the cheapest, we are here to make the Best Silicone Baking Mats which will give you years of use and the best possible experience. What makes our Silicone Baking Mats the best is the attention to detail! Our Half Sheet Size Silicone Mats come in 2 sizes, why? Because a Half Sheet Size Baking Pan is slightly smaller than a Half Sheet Size Cookie Sheet and a \"One Size Fits All\" approach will not provide you with the best fit. Our Cookie Sheet Silicone Mats are sized to fit perfectly on Cookie Sheets, that are 2\" wider than a Half Sheet Size Baking Pans. Now you can get the perfect fitting Cookie Sheet Silicone Mat for your 17\" X 14\" Cookie Sheets. Our thin edge design provides greater useable baking area. We have all been taught to stay inside the lines so we have found in our research that subconsciously bakers will “stay inside the lines” when we they use a silicone baking mat. Our thin edge design provides over 20% more useable baking area compared to all others, while staying “inside the lines”! When you are done using them just wash with a mild dish soap and water or better yet, place them in the dishwasher! They come fully backed with our 100% Money Back Guarantee and all purchases include our 200+ Recipe eCookbook that is emailed to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Jn23vaq7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Executive Chef","source_asin":"B00MLDM3QS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MLDM3QS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MLDM3QS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
