window.products.push({"id":492286,"name":"Cheer Collection Boomerang Shaped Bed Pillow, Side Sleeper Neck Pillow for Women and Men with Washable Cover, Ergonomic Pillow with Contoured Support ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tSjMHPt8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Support Posture Alignment & Enjoy A Good Night’s Sleep With Our Cheer Collection Boomerang Shape Bed Pillow!  We combine an ergonomic U-shaped design with gentle and breathable materials to bring you a soft, comfortable, and firm pillow that offers support for your posture, neck pain, and helps you stay comfy throughout the night.  This supportive pillow molds and contours to the shape of your body to help reduce pressure on a variety of body parts including your back, shoulders, and neck while keeping them in alignment so you can wake up feeling refreshed. Convenient, Versatile & Comfortable – Made For Everyday Use  When it comes to your comfort, we don’t make any exceptions. This is why we use a poly cotton cover with soft and firm filling to offer more support and comfort while maintaining a lightweight so you can carry it with you anywhere.  Our side sleeper pillow for women and men is made with everyday use in mind. It’s breathable and gentle on the skin so you can enjoy a peaceful night’s sleep and support your posture while staying cool, comfortable, and dry. Features You’ll Love: - Suitable for women and men to ensure comfort in any position - Ergonomic U-shaped design contours to the shape of your neck - Offers just the right balance of softness and breathability - Lightweight, easy to carry, and convenient for day to day use - Can easily be cleaned by machine washing and fluffing it up again - Made using quality materials to provide long term use Enjoy Comforting & Deep Sleep Every Night In Any Position With Our Cheer Collection Boomerang Pillow!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tSjMHPt8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheer Collection","source_asin":"B09PHTM7ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PHTM7ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PHTM7ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
