window.products.push({"id":492334,"name":"BINO Bakeware Nonstick Square Baking Pan, 9 Inch - Speckled Black | Premium Quality Textured Cake Pan with Even-Flow Technology | Dishwasher Safe | No","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PKeKSz4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EVEN-FLOW TECHNOLOGY - Bakeware’s textured nonstick surface promotes quick and effortless food release and enhances airflow to bake and brown foods evenly NON-TOXIC - Ditch the chemicals with BINO's carbon steel bakeware. Our bakeware's coating does not include potentially toxic materials like PFOA, PTFE, other PFAs, lead, cadmium, or toxic metals DISHWASHER SAFE - Use these baking pans without the hassle of cleaning. Nonstick coating makes cooking residue slide right off. Just rinse under water or run through the dishwasher HIGH QUALITY - BINO's professional premium quality bakeware are sure to last. They are made with ultra durable heavy gauge carbon steel for everyday use. Sturdy construction resists warping to keep you baking for years DIMENSIONS - 9 Inch pan measures 9.5\" L x 9.5\" W with a 2.2\" Depth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PKeKSz4HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B08V7KK3MB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V7KK3MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V7KK3MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":492335,"name":"Twin Size Mattress Pad, Waterproof Breathable Ultra-Soft Mattress Cover, Quilted Alternative Filling, 8-21 inches Deep Pocket Fitted Bed Protector (Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i9SCfinOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATERPROOF & NOISELESS: Our twin mattress pad has a 100% waterproof TPU backing. It effectively protects your valuable mattress against urine, sweat, bedwetting, or accidental spills and keeps it clean. You will not hear any annoying plastics noise when you sleep or move on it. ULTRA SOFT & BREATHABLE: The top of the twin mattress pad is made of microfiber for extra softness. Our upgrade four clover surfaces hold the filling evenly in each box, which provides perfect air circulation because of the filling inside. Offering a clean and fresh sleeping environment for you and your family. DEEP POCKET DESIGN: Twin mattress pad is 39\"x75\" inches. Fitted sheet style provides ultimate protection from the top and sides of the mattress, fit 8-21 inches in depth. Anti-slip bottom and durable elastic skirt will wrap the mattress tightly, fix the mattress in place all night. 24H SAFEGUARD PAD: Our twin waterproof mattress protector has OEKO-TEX certification. It is free of PVC, vinyl, BPA, phthalate, or other harmful chemicals for materials. A great choice for kids in the process of potty training, elderly, or new mothers. EASY TO CLEAN: Machine washable. Wash with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low to extend the service life of TPU. Do not iron or bleach. It can be used in homes, hotels, hospitals, dorms, etc. We offer a 90-day full refund with no questions asked and 24-hour customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i9SCfinOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safe and Sound","source_asin":"B099DT8NBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099DT8NBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099DT8NBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":492336,"name":"GLORHOME Twin-Over-Twin Low Bunk Bed with Slide Ladder & Guardrail for Kids, Teens, Space-Saving, No Box Spring Needed, Grey3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ijqJzJqMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep in style with the customizable, space-saving design of the twin over twin bunk bed. The increased sleeping capacity is a common-sense solution for cottages, extended family, out-of-town guests, or hosting your rambunctious friends for a sleepover. The bunk bed features clean lines and horizontal slats with a built-in stepladder to access the top bunk. Each bed features its personal space with easy dependable access in and out. 【Low Bunk Beds with Ladder】 Easy access to the upper bed with solid ladder, safe and sturdy climbing for you, as well as a safety bar for the top bunk. 【Low Bunk Bed with Slide】 The unique slide design meets the family members’ game needs.Everyone will love the multifunctional design, it will can turns your living room into a playroom. But easily removes when it’s no longer needed. The slide and the ladder are convertible, both of them can be put left or right. 【Rugged Wooden Frame】 Quality tested sturdy wooden construction features solid support, made of high-quality solid wood and MDF. And there are two stunning colors suitable for everyone, can be used safely for a long time. 【Perfect Design】 Finish in layers for a smooth, flawless surface. All finishes are sealed with a sealed with a protective,safe lacquer. The high-quality veneers make the surface has a rich and consistent color tones, holds up over time, both in aesthetic appearance and performance. 【Easy To Assemble】This bunk twin bed frame is packaged with all accessories and hardware. It’s easy to assemble the bed frame with step by step instruction. Description Material : Pine wood +MDF Size : Twin/Twin Color : White/gray Numbers of package : 1 Assembly required : Yes Origin : Vietnam Dimensions : Overall Product Dimension : 79.3''L*84.4''W*46.5''H Package Dimension : Please refer to the Specification Upper bed dimension : 76''x39.1'' Down bed dimension : 76''x39.1'' Slide dimension : 56.8''x14.8'' Total Height : 46.5'' Overall Product Weight : 92.5lb Bunk Bed Weight Capability : 400lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ijqJzJqMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLORHOME","source_asin":"B0B3NHHRHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3NHHRHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3NHHRHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":492337,"name":"Lynnlov 100% Cotton Cable Knit Throw Blanket for Couch 50\" x 60\", Ultra Soft Cozy Chic Travel Knitted Blankets for Bedroom Living Room, Decorative Lig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QbMevt0sL._AC_.jpg","description":"★【PREMIUM SOFTNESS & COZY SKIN FRIENDLY】: The Lynnlov knit blanket is made of 100% pure natural cotton material, which can fits the skin better, has high elasticity and is more comfortable to use. Cotton blanket has fine and soft touch, more lightweight and breathable, and takes you to enjoy the comfortable sleep of ecological health. ★【EXQUISITE DESIGN & SUPERIOR QUALITY】: The navy throw blanket adopts the classic cable knit pattern, with fashionable and exquisite workmanship, vivid and bright color, which not only comfortable, but also provides a special decoration for your space. Woven blanket through the perfect combination of traditional technology and modern technology, fine stitching, anti stripping hemming, elegant appearance. ★【MULTI OCCASION & ALL SEASONS】: The soft blanket is suitable for baby blanket, sofa & bed blanket, car blanket, pet blanket, outdoor picnic blanket, airplane travel blanket, decorative blanket, office shawl, etc. Its air permeability, moisture absorption and perspiration properties can keep the fresh and comfortable, no matter what occasion or season, this all-weather accent blanket is the ideal choice for you to enjoy your leisure time. ★【EASY TO CARE & CONVENIENT TO MAINTAIN】: The blankets & throws is recommended to be washed in a laundry bag (with complimentary laundry bag), machine wash less than 30℃ cold water in a gentle cycle, which is not easy to deform. And the lightweight blanket will be softer if you use little softener when soaking. The soaking time in about 15 minutes. ★【100% SATISFACTION SECURED】: LYNNLOV has always adhered to the concept of quality first and is committed to creating better products, and all of our cozy blankets have passed the Oeko-Tex Standard 100 test, you can rest assured to buy. For any reason you're not satisfied, please kindly let us know and our customer service team will help you RETURN or REFUND unconditionally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QbMevt0sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lynnlov","source_asin":"B0964TY3GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0964TY3GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0964TY3GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":492338,"name":"One (1) MARA STONEWARE COLLECTION - 16 Oz Coffee Or Tea Cup Collectible Dinner Mug - Snowflakes Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QNXNYNd2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce. After studying art in London, she began working with high-temperature ceramics and created wonderful unique glazes for her pieces. She then went to study with Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese in Italy. Mara has had many expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico.She developed a fine sensibility in schematic and precise line drawings. Ceramics is no easy medium for precise line drawings, yet Mara mastered her technique with brush and stylus and has been able to portray her life experiences with unrivaled naturalness. We see her universe on parade in all of her work. Flowers, birds and geometric designs all represent her personal vision and display her unique perceptions of the world.After a long illness, Mara passed away in 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine work has continued. Mara's husband, children and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara's legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.Mara was a very prolific artist and while her current designs are still in production, she has left numerous yet un-introduced designs to be presented in the future. Alexandra, carrying on her mother's fine tradition, has also been creating ceramic designs which we were honored to debut and continue to offer. Mara brought all the beauty of her soul to walk this earth. We are ever grateful for her creative gifts and pray that her journey continues in beauty and love. We take great pleasure in knowing that Mara's artistic ware’s will grace all of our lives for many years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QNXNYNd2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Structures","source_asin":"B004C7RQFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004C7RQFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004C7RQFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
