window.products.push({"id":492447,"name":"Apple Peelers, Apple Peeler Slicer Corer 3-in-1 Function, Durable Stainless Steel Suction Cup Kitchen Peeler with 2pc Extra Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lE6I3unJL._AC_.jpg","description":"🍑🍑🍑 【Material】：This apple slicer contains a 304 stainless steel body, an alloy rotating screw and a vacuum-based silicone suction cup, which can be very durable and not easy to break. The package contains a spare blade, which is used to replace the accessories of wearing parts, thereby prolonging the service life of the product. 🍑🍑🍑【Operation】：Fix the pull-rod sucker of the peeler corer slicer firmly on any smooth surface and grab the rotating screw and pull it to the head. Put the tail of the apple, potato or pear on the three-tooth fork to make it even Shake the handle at a speed. All blades can be adjusted to achieve the results you want 🍑🍑🍑 【Advantages】： Compared with other simple peelers, it is easier and faster to peel, has a wide range of use, does not cause unnecessary waste, and is easy to use. It has the functions of 3 and 1, peeling/removing Nucleation and slicing can be carried out at the same time, beautiful and generous with good visual effects 🍑🍑🍑【Cleaning】The size of the apple corer and slicer is 11.2’’x3.94’’x5.1’’. After use, the blade can be washed with water, and the main body can be scrubbed with a clean damp cloth, because some parts of it are relatively sharp. It is recommended to bring kitchen rubber gloves when cleaning to avoid cuts. 🍑🍑🍑 [Use] For gourmets, this apple peeler corer is a very friendly choice. Used in outdoor barbecues, restaurants, hotels and home kitchens and other places, you can make it make exquisite fruit salads, fruit pies, canned food, etc. to enrich your table. You can also give it as a gift to your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lE6I3unJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tekirose","source_asin":"B09SWXKDVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SWXKDVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SWXKDVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
