window.products.push({"id":492632,"name":"HALLEY Decorative Turkish Towels Set, 6 Pieces - Highly Absorbent & Fade Resistant Fabric, 100% Cotton - 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels, 2 Washcloths - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919kSHqBTQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You may ask yourself, why choose the Decorative Bath Towels Set? These 100% cotton premium Turkish bath towels, hand towels and washcloths are made with the utmost care from high quality, soft cotton textile, measuring 600 GSM. They are tested and inspected numerous times throughout the creation process to maintain optimal comfort, absorbance, beauty and safety. That's why you can always order from us with confidence. Customer service is one of our top priorities. We know that you will love this decorative Turkish Towel Set, but if for some reason you don’t, simply reach out to us and let us know. Our company will give you a prompt response and offer you a full refund and pay for your return shipping, no questions asked! Finest Turkish Cotton Craftmanship The 600 GSM production standard is some of the highest in the industry for a heavyweight and hotel quality towel set. You will notice the meticulous attention to detail that we have put in to each and every towel set! Hotel Spa Quality These Turkish bathroom towels are created with floral decorative trim on one side to add a luxurious aesthetic. Like spa towels, they are ultra-soft, warm, cozy and highly absorbent to give you that feel of being on vacation, even though you are in the comfort of your own home! Long Lasting & Durable Construction Rest easy knowing that this decorative bathroom towel set will last you for years to come! We have manufactured these towel sets with premium grade cotton to withstand daily, routine usage without pilling, withering or ripping. Machine Washable and Dryer Friendly When you are done using these towels simply hang them up and let them dry or throw them in the washing machine! The quick-dry technology will allow you to reuse these towels numerous times. They are 100% machine washable and dryer friendly. In fact, they get softer and more absorbent with every wash!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919kSHqBTQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HALLEY","source_asin":"B0BXBHY1GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXBHY1GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXBHY1GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
