window.products.push({"id":492643,"name":"NOVICA Artisan Crafted Hand Blown Cobalt Blue Recycled Glass Margarita Glasses, 11 Oz, Deep Blue' (Set Of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rl8dSy2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Poised graciously on transparent stems, margarita glasses glow in deep cobalt blue. The set of six is handcrafted by Javier and Efrén, using glass-blowing techniques perfected over more than thirty years. Endlessly versatile, they do double duty at dessert time for sherbet, custard, or gelatin.  Because each piece is handmade, shape and size can vary slightly and tiny bubbles may appear within the glass. This exemplifies the hand-blown technique, making every piece a unique example of blown glass craftsmanship.  - Dishwasher: use top rack only. Hand wash recommended. - This hand blown item may vary slightly in color, size and shape - Free of lead and toxins   About our Artist: 'This type of work is a beautiful craft. I love blown glass because of the pure imagination poured into every piece created,\" confides Efren. Working as a team, Javier specializes in the design of the pieces, and Efren transforms the designs into a reality. 'Efren and I make a great team. Over the years we have worked hard to design truly original styles with a distinctly Mexican accent,' says Javier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rl8dSy2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00016B1OW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00016B1OW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00016B1OW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
