window.products.push({"id":492652,"name":"Kanntie 3 Pieces Heart Cookie Cutter Set - Premium Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e5aWzA0oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a love shaped cookie mold for party, this cookie cutters set would be a good choice. SET INCLUDES: 3* Heart cutter - 1* Large Heart (3 x 2.8 x 1in)- 1* Medium Heart (2.2 x 2 x 1in)- 1* Small Heart (1.4 x 1.3 x 1in) FEATURES 1 INCH DEEP CUT. LFGB and US quality certification.Premium Food-grade stainless steel, BPA-free and Non-toxic. Comfortable and Smooth edges, protect your hands.NOT Dishwasher Safe, not easy to rust, easy to clean, please keep clean and dry thoroughly after use. IDEAS FOR USE Great as a cake decoration, pancake mold, or for cutting cookie dough, fondant, soft fruits, biscuits, brownies, bread, sandwiches, cheese, chocolate or craft clay. These cookie cutters are sure to delight people of all ages. Use it to cut out cookies or anything else soft. Perfect for Baby shower, Christmas, Birthday, Wedding, Party, Halloween, Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day and other days or festivals that are worth celebrating. QUALITY WARRANTY Like all Kanntie products our utensils are made to last with durable, quality materials. We offer a full refund or replacement if you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase. Any questions, please feel free to contact us. Wish you a happy shopping!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e5aWzA0oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kanntie","source_asin":"B07WR8HKDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WR8HKDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WR8HKDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":492653,"name":"BLACK+DECKER 16V MAX Flex Cordless Stick Vacuum with Floor Head, Cordless (Discontinued Model BDH1620FLFH)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sIvaoK73L._AC_.jpg","description":"BLACK+DECKER 16v MAX* Lithium Flex Vac View larger A Cordless Vacuum That Does It All Finally a cordless vacuum that does it all; from floor to ceiling and everything in between, the 16V MAX* Lithium Flex Vac with Floor Head offers limitless versatility. Choose between the four foot extendable hose or the new stick vac attachment with pivoting floor head. Having an optional stick vac attachment makes this the ultimate in portable and multi-functional vacuuming. No longer just a simple hand-carried vacuum, the Flex Vac provides easy clean-up; high or low, in the house or car, and on any floor surface – wood, tile, carpet, rugs, etc. The compact design and lightweight yet powerful 16V MAX* lithium ion battery, makes it easy to take the Flex straight to the mess. Easy to Use and Easy to Clean This Flex Vac features a removable, washable bowl and filter for thorough cleaning. Included with the Flex is a charging base with tool storage, a flip-up dusting brush, a crevice tool, and the stick vac attachment with pivoting floor head. Each of these attachments and extensions helps get in to hard-to-reach areas like under the table, in between car seats, stairs, ceiling fans, etc. BLACK+DECKER With a heritage of more than 100 years as one of the most trusted brands in the world, the new BLACK+DECKER identity builds on that trust by providing innovative and reliable products. Along with a meaningful, emotional, and empowering experience for the home, the new BLACK+DECKER products will be Honest. Intuitive. Involved. Thoughtful. View larger 16V MAX* Lithium Hand Vac The always -ready and convenient 16V MAX* Lithium Hand Vac is perfect for handy cleaning anywhere and anytime. The high-performance motor delivers strong suction for messes big and small, and the cyclonic action and strong suction of the 16V MAX* Lithium Hand Vac make cleanup easy and fast. View larger Cordless, Portable and Ultra-Compact This vac is cordless, portable and ultra-compact so you can tackle chores without lugging out your vacuum. Cyclonic action spins dirt away from the filter to help maintain performance, and the 3-Stage filtration system prevents dust and debris from escaping for clean air exhaust. View larger Stick Vac Floor Extension The stick vac floor extension converts Flex vac for larger cleaning jobs, along with a 4ft flexible hose and attachments for convenient, cordless cleaning that reaches everywhere. This Hand Vac also comes with a rotating slim nozzle, an on-board upholstery brush, and a crevice tool. View larger Lithium vs NiCad Other types of batteries fade and lose suction, making it difficult for users to complete their cleaning task before running out of power. Instead, Lithium Ion batteries offer strong suction and fade-free power throughout their use. Users will now have the confidence that they can complete tasks quickly, efficiently, and conveniently with this new Flex Vac. View larger Charging Station and Base The 16V MAX* Lithium Hand Vac has a quick charging base that keeps the unit charged and accessories organized. Additional features of the 16V MAX* Lithium Hand Vac include a charge indicator light and a removable and washable bowl. View larger What's in the Box: (1) Vacuum with 4 ft. flexible hose, (1) Stick Vac floor head, (1) 2-in-1 nozzle/brush tool, (1) long crevice tool, (1) charging base, (1) washable filter (model PVF110).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sIvaoK73L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B0B45566KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B45566KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B45566KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
