window.products.push({"id":492839,"name":"SOFFEE DESIGN Vintage 60-Minute Kitchen Timer, Snail Shape Without Batteries, Loud Alarm Dial Rotating Countdown Timer for Cooking Baking Sports Games","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jdfA4CSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Specifications】Measures approx.: 4.5 x 2.4 x 3 inches; Weight: 1lbs; Material: iron; It can time up to 60 minutes and is your little helper in the kitchen, housework, work, and study! 【Convenient To Use】Rotate the pointer clockwise once, then turn it counterclockwise back to the number of minutes you need to count, and it will begin to count down. When there are 60 seconds left, it will send out an alarm to remind you, and then complete the remaining time. 【Functional & Attractive】This cute snail shape timer is operated by a mechanical spring and does not require power supply, making it more durable and convenient. At the same time, when it is not in use, it can also be used as a small and exquisite pastoral decoration, which is the best choice for decorating the room! 【Unique Design】The old style, simulating the treatment of falling paint, makes it look more retro. The weighty base and the lifelike snail statue form this unique and lovely little object. 【Creative Decor】The creative combination of timer and snail, classical iron workmanship, finely restore the skin texture of snail, from the front, it is a small and practical timer. On the other hand, it turns into a cute and lifelike little snail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jdfA4CSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFFEE DESIGN","source_asin":"B08XMCK3Z7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XMCK3Z7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XMCK3Z7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
