window.products.push({"id":492893,"name":"Raybee 63\" Garage Shelving Heavy Duty, 2000LBS Storage Shelves Heavy Duty, Pantry Shelves for Kitchen Storage, Kitchen Shelves with 5 Tier Metal Shelv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m7sN3QxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GARAGE STORAGE SHELVES WITH 2 THICK LAYERS METAL LEG. Made of quality metal and composed of double layers 2.2mm thick leg supporting, which makes the industrial metal shelving heavy duty not only much more steadily and tough than normal storage shelves, but also contain 2000 lbs weight capacity to organize much more stuffs. ADJUSTABLE GARAGE SHELVING UNIT AND STORAGE MEETS DIFFERENT USE. Raybee heavy duty garage shelves is designed with adjustable connector, the height of each layer is not only adjustable through moving the cross bar up or down to meet different height of varied objects need, but also the boards can be assembled or disassembled into several different tier shelving unit, like 2 horizontal heavy duty shelving as workbench or 1 vertical heavy duty metal shelves for storage. 32\"W x 16.5\"D x 63\"H GARAGE SHELVING HEAVY DUTY WITH WIDELY APPLICATION. The garage storage rack is versatile for garage, kitchen, warehouse, living room, bedroom, basement, workplace, and etc. 5-tier metal shelving unit not only enlarge your storage space to keep your home neat and organized, but also easy to store when not in use. EASY ASSEMBLE WITHIN 10 MINUTES. The metal shelving for garage takes special interlocking design to make it assembled quickly, and the package also came with a rubber mallet to make assemble much more easier, there is no nuts or bolts required, you can quickly assemble every stand alone sturdy shelves for strorage within 10 minutes alone. Tips: We offer a rubber mallet and a pair of gloves for your convenience. SAY GOODBYE TO STRONG SMELL. Raybee utility shelf use thickened metal boards instead of flimsy particle board. Two support ribs at the back of metal boards ensure the support capacity and safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m7sN3QxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raybee","source_asin":"B08NDRFXBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NDRFXBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NDRFXBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
