window.products.push({"id":492942,"name":"LE TAUCI Soup Bowls with Handle, 15 Oz Ceramic French Onion Soup Bowls, Large Soup Crocks Oven Safe for Stew, Onion, Soup, Chilli,Reactive Glaze, Set ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EhSzRYCxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable Handle Design - This onion soup bowl has a perfect 3.5 inch length and ergonomic handle shape to make your grip more comfortable. There are two holes under the handle to prevent the rupture caused by thermal expansion and cold contraction, and better discharge the residual water after cleaning. Multi-use For Every Dinner - 15 ounce soup bowl is a perfect size to make everyone enjoy their own soup. Although it is originally and specifically designed for French Onion Soup it is also perfect for soup, oatmeal, cereal, chowders, beef stew, chicken pot pies etc. Great Quality For Heathy Life - These french onion soup bowls are made of some strong stuff. Soup bowls proudly quality approved stoneware. The superior durability and edge strength will ensure years of use. Easy To Clean - The surface of the ceramic bowl is smooth and glazed , easy to clean , you just need to rinse with soap and water , and is also suitable for dishwasher , oven , microwave and refrigerator safety and can withstand 482°F . Wonderful Collocation Of Table - Healthy and classic, makes for great companion dishes to any table setting. Not only will it fill your stomach, ceramic soup bowls will fill your life with ritual. If you give them to your dear friends and family who own such a simple and delicate set of onion bowls, they will be very happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EhSzRYCxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE TAUCI","source_asin":"B08G4LD1JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-492942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G4LD1JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G4LD1JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
